{"id": "t051-001", "text": "Caught up with Divya over lunch. Her son Anil starts reception on September 4th and she's already dreading the drop off. Her husband's taking the morning off to go with them. Anil's apparently very excited about his new lunchbox and has already picked which peg he wants. Divya's going back to work full time the week after, which is part of the stress. Remind me to text her that afternoon to see how it went, and maybe again on the Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anil", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "reception", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "September 4th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading the drop off", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anil", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited about his new lunchbox", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going back to work full time", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "stress", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that afternoon", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t051-004", "text": "Long chat with Dong after squash. He got made redundant last week, along with half his team. He's weirdly calm about it, says he wants to retrain as a teacher. His wife Emily is less calm. They've got the mortgage renewal coming up in January and Emily's worried the bank won't play ball without a payslip. Dong has a careers advice session on November 6 at 10am and has already signed up for an open evening at the uni. Remind me to send him Marcus's number, Marcus did the same switch a few years back.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dong", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "weirdly calm", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to retrain as a teacher", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emily", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "less calm", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "mortgage renewal", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emily", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried the bank won't play ball without a payslip", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dong", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "careers advice session", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "November 6 at 10am", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "open evening at the uni", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him Marcus's number", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marcus", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marcus", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "EVENT", "text": "same switch", "owner": "p5", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few years back", "anchor": "e5"}]}
{"id": "t051-005", "text": "Julien and Sophie got a puppy!! Cockapoo called Pickle, eight weeks old, picked her up yesterday evening. Julien says she's already chewed a shoe.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sophie", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got a puppy", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Cockapoo called Pickle", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday evening", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t051-006", "text": "Oliver graduates from Leeds on July 18th, ceremony at 2pm. His mum Adaeze is flying over from Lagos for it. Don't forget to get him something, he mentioned wanting a decent pair of headphones.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oliver", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduates from Leeds", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "July 18th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "2pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "mum", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adaeze", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying over from Lagos", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get him something", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wanting a decent pair of headphones", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t051-007", "text": "Bumped into Chris at the school gates. His daughter has her 11+ on the 12th at half 9 and is a bag of nerves about it. Chris isn't sleeping much either. Chris says she's fine with English but freezes on the maths, and they've been doing past papers every night after tea. Results come out mid October. His son's doing the same thing in two years so this is the trial run. Text her good luck the night before?", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chris", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "11+", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 12th at half 9", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bag of nerves", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chris", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "isn't sleeping much", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chris", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine with English", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "freezes on the maths", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Results", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "mid October", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "same thing", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in two years", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text her good luck", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t051-012", "text": "Emily called about Jonah. He's got his first day at nursery Monday morning and she's more anxious than he is. Her mum is coming down on Sunday to help. Remind me to ask her Monday night how he settled.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emily", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jonah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first day at nursery", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "anxious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming down", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her Monday night how he settled", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday night", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t051-015", "text": "Rin's rabbit escaped again. Found it in next door's garden. Very funny story but no harm done.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "rabbit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "escaped", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t051-016", "text": "Bogdan's last day at the warehouse was Friday, they shut the whole site. He had leaving drinks at the Crown, which I missed. Has an interview at Amazon on 11/3 at 1pm. He's been at that site eleven years so it's a lot. His wife's due in the spring which isn't helping the stress. I should text him good luck the morning of, and ask Vikram if there's anything going at his place.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bogdan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "last day at the warehouse", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving drinks at the Crown", "event_type": "party", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview at Amazon", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "11/3 at 1pm", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "stress", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text him good luck", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the morning of", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Vikram if there's anything going at his place", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vikram", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t051-017", "text": "Zeynep's kids both start at the new school after half term. Her eldest is nervous about making friends. Zeynep's husband Marcus got a job in Reading so that's why they moved. She loves the new house though, big garden.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zeynep", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new school", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after half term", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "eldest", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous about making friends", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zeynep", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marcus", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job in Reading", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "loves the new house", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "big garden", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}]}
{"id": "t051-019", "text": "Quick one: Divya's cat Mango is having a tooth out on Friday at 9am. She's worried about the anaesthetic because he's 14.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Mango", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "having a tooth out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at 9am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried about the anaesthetic", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t051-024", "text": "Dong's grandad died last night. He's flying to Shanghai tomorrow at 6am for the funeral, back maybe the 30th. Remind me to message him while he's out there, just to check he's ok.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dong", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying to Shanghai", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow at 6am", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 30th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message him", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "while he's out there", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t051-026", "text": "Oliver's dog Bramble has to be put down. Vet's coming to the house Wednesday at 5. He's gutted, had her since uni. Should drop off something, maybe flowers for him and Adaeze.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oliver", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Bramble", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "put down", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday at 5", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop off something, maybe flowers for him and Adaeze", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adaeze", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t051-032", "text": "Keisha's twins finished primary today. Leavers' assembly was at 2. She sent a video of them doing the dance, absolutely mortifying for them. Secondary starts September 3rd.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Keisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "twins", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "finished primary", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Leavers' assembly", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "2", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Secondary", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "September 3rd", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t051-041", "text": "Callum Hughes, the one from five-a-side, said his son starts Year 1 tomorrow and has a new teacher he's scared of. Callum's doing drop off at 8:45.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Callum Hughes", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from five-a-side", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Year 1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "teacher he's scared of", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Callum", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "8:45", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t051-042", "text": "Bogdan's wife had the baby! Little boy, born 3:12am on Tuesday. Bogdan's on paternity leave until Nov 20. Need to sort a present, she said they need nothing but nappies.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bogdan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "had the baby", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3:12am on Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bogdan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "paternity leave", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until Nov 20", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort a present", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "need nothing but nappies", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t051-043", "text": "Zeynep's guinea pig died, the kids are devastated. They're having a little garden funeral for it Saturday morning, Marcus is digging the hole. Bless them.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zeynep", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "guinea pig", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "devastated", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "little garden funeral", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday morning", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marcus", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t051-047", "text": "Divya and Anil are doing a big joint party for their parents' 40th on Saturday 8th at 7. Tiago and Anan are coming too. I'm bringing the dessert. Divya says her dad wants a new watch, if we're chipping in.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anil", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "big joint party", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "40th", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday 8th at 7", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tiago", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants a new watch", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "r2"}]}
{"id": "t051-048", "text": "Hannah's grandmother died on Thursday night. Hannah's going to Cork for the funeral, flight is Monday at 7am, back Thursday. She asked if I could water the plants. Send her a message Monday evening to see how she's holding up.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hannah", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandmother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hannah", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going to Cork", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday at 7am", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send her a message", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t051-050", "text": "Talked to Jada and Dong at the pub. Jada's kid lost her first tooth, the tooth fairy paid a whole two quid. Dong's back from Shanghai, says the funeral was really hard but he's glad he went. Jada's moving flats on the 1st, from Peckham to a two-bed in Lewisham, so her daughter finally gets her own room. Dong offered his van. He also said his mum is coming to stay with them in December for a month, first time since his grandad died.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dong", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kid", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lost her first tooth", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dong", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back from Shanghai", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "glad he went", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving flats", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 1st", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "two-bed in Lewisham", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1", "same_as": "r1"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dong", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming to stay", "owner": "r3", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in December", "anchor": "e5"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "a month", "anchor": "e5"}, {"id": "r4", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e6", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t051-053", "text": "Chris's dad's funeral was on Thursday. He said it went as well as it could, lots of people came. He's taking next week off. Check on him a couple of weeks from now when everyone else has stopped asking.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chris", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Check on him", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "a couple of weeks from now", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "when everyone else has stopped asking", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t051-056", "text": "Keisha's dog Coco had puppies, six of them, on Sunday night! She's keeping one and selling the rest. Asked if I want one. I don't. I really do.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Keisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Coco", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "had puppies", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday night", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t051-057", "text": "Tiago's uncle lost his job at the factory and is moving back to Porto. Tiago is pretty upset, they're close. The leaving do is next Friday at 8.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tiago", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "uncle", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lost his job at the factory", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving back to Porto", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tiago", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty upset", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "close", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving do", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Friday at 8", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t051-058", "text": "Anan had a rough week. Her dog Lola died suddenly on Tuesday and then her boss announced restructuring. She's worried about her role, the meeting's Thursday at 11. Wei says she's not sleeping. Lola was twelve and they'd had her since she was a pup, so it's hit both of them hard. Wei's been working from home to be around. Anan says if the restructure goes badly she might take it as a sign and go freelance. Text her Thursday at lunch to check in.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anan", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Lola", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "restructuring", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried about her role", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "meeting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday at 11", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wei", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "not sleeping", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wei", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anan", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday at lunch", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t051-060", "text": "Long catch up with Sophie, Julien and their friend Lior. Sophie's started a new job after the layoff, a design agency in town, really likes it. Julien's training for the Brighton half in April. Lior's son starts uni in York in September and Lior is not coping well with the idea of an empty house. Pickle the puppy is now enormous and has been banned from the sofa. Sophie wants us all round for dinner on the 18th at 7. I said I'll bring wine.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sophie", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "friend", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lior", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sophie", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "layoff", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "design agency", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "likes it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Brighton half", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in April", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lior", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "uni in York", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lior", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "not coping well with the idea of an empty house", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "Pickle the puppy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "p8", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sophie", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 18th at 7", "anchor": "e5"}]}
